# Delivery box (issues 062, 099): a plain cardboard box seen near top-down, with an ink outline: a thin dark north face along the top, the lid with tape down the middle and a flat blank label. No print, no brand. 1x1 tile; sits on the floor in front of the front door and is only there while a package waits.
size: 16x16
